additional_terms.Call Values:
With respect to each Underlying on the first Call Observation Date, 100.00% of its Starting Value;
With respect to each Underlying on the second Call Observation Date, 97.50% of its Starting Value;
With respect to each Underlying on the third Call Observation Date, 95.00% of its Starting Value; and
With respect to each Underlying on the fourth Call Observation Date, 92.50% of its Starting Value.
